          "Description": "select \"1\" for 30 degree parking, \"2\" for 45 degree parking, \"3\" for 60 degree parking, and \"4\" for 90 degree parking. Note that the angles are not applied to the perimeter parking bays and herringbone pattern. The herringbone pattern will always be at 45 degrees.\n\nint\nDefault value : 1",
